sequenceDiagram
    participant J as Deployment job
    participant C as Controller
    participant I as Mesh ingress
    participant N as Execution node
    participant T as Target
    N->>I: Open outbound mTLS connection
    J->>C: Request reviewed commit over SSH
    C->>C: Fetch project and claim request
    C->>I: Submit signed work through local socket
    I-->>N: Deliver work over established connection
    N->>T: Run Ansible over SSH or WinRM
    T-->>N: Task results
    N-->>I: Stream execution results
    I-->>C: Record result and mesh UUID
    C-->>J: Return exit code
    J->>C: Retrieve original result archive
    C-->>J: Metadata and result files
